# arlowe overlay -- replaces upstream pi-gen's
# stage0/00-configure-apt/files/sources.list.
#
# Do NOT edit the copy under pi-gen/: that tree is rm -rf'd and re-cloned at
# PIGEN_REF by scripts/build-image.sh, so an edit there is erased, silently, on
# the next build. Edit overlays/pi-gen/ and re-record the digest in
# overlays/pi-gen/MANIFEST.
#
# What changed from upstream: the three archive lines, and the three commented
# deb-src lines, now name one fixed snapshot.debian.org timestamp instead of the
# rolling Debian mirror. A rolling mirror serves a different package set on any
# two days, which is how the kernel drifted underneath a vendored driver. The
# deb-src lines are pinned too so that uncommenting one does not silently leave
# the pin.
#
# The literal hostname of the rolling mirror is deliberately absent from this
# file, comments included: the built rootfs is grepped for it as evidence that
# nothing resolved off-pin, and a mention here would make that check pass on its
# own comment.
#
# Note the security suite lives under a DIFFERENT archive root
# (archive/debian-security/, not archive/debian/). Getting that wrong yields a
# 404 mid-bootstrap. http:// rather than https:// is deliberate; see
# docs/architecture/0009-build-input-pinning.md.
#
# The suite placeholder below is substituted by 00-run.sh. Leave it alone.
deb http://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian/20260915T000000Z RELEASE main contrib non-free non-free-firmware
deb http://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian-security/20260915T000000Z RELEASE-security main contrib non-free non-free-firmware
deb http://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian/20260915T000000Z RELEASE-updates main contrib non-free non-free-firmware
# Uncomment deb-src lines below then 'apt-get update' to enable 'apt-get source'
#deb-src http://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian/20260915T000000Z RELEASE main contrib non-free non-free-firmware
#deb-src http://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian-security/20260915T000000Z RELEASE-security main contrib non-free non-free-firmware
#deb-src http://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian/20260915T000000Z RELEASE-updates main contrib non-free non-free-firmware
